WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/driving/components/drive-detail/EnergySummaryPanel.tsx — a PURE presentational leaf fed the
  `drive` (DriveDetail) + `stats` (DriveStats) props by its parent (the Drive Detail page) and the distance
  preference from `useUnits().unitPrefs.distance`. It renders:
    GlassPanel(p-5) → header[ <BatteryCharging/> (green) + <h3> {t('driveDetail.energySummary','Energy Summary')} ]
                    → grid-cols-2 / sm:3 / lg:6 of six metric cells (muted 10px label over a bold text-lg tinted value):
        1 Energy Consumed  (amber)  : energyWh > 1000 ? fmtWithUnit(energyWh/1000,'kWh') : `${fmtNumber(energyWh)} Wh`
        2 Energy Recovered (green)  : same ladder on regenWh
        3 Net Consumption  (cyan)   : same ladder on (energyWh - regenWh)
        4 Efficiency       (purple) : consumptionWhKm > 0 ? `${fmtNumber(consumptionWhKm × (mi?1.609344:1))} ${'Wh/mi'|'Wh/km'}` : '—'
        5 Battery Used     (amber)  : start&&end!=null ? `${start-end}%` : '—'  + sub `${start ?? '?'}% → ${end ?? '?'}%`
        6 Range Used       (green)  : startRange&&endRange!=null ? fmtWithUnit(startRange-endRange, 'mi'|'km') : '—'
  Data sources (prompt): useTranslation + useUnits. No data-fetching hook — it is a presentational leaf; the only
  per-cell branches are the em-dash fallbacks above (reproduced verbatim). fmtNumber = 2-decimal locale format,
  safeNumber coerces non-finite → 0; fmtWithUnit = `${fmtNumber(v)} ${unit}`. Energy threshold is a STRICT `> 1000`.

